137
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,360
Yeah.

138
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,399
Actually, I also knew it.

139
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,600
You knew it?

140
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,639
I knew.

141
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,839
Basically, the whole group knew it.

142
00:03:11,839 --> 00:03:12,520
Everyone knew,

143
