154
00:03:27,399 --> 00:03:28,440
So I scrolled through my photos.

155
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,119
Luckily, I had old dinner photos saved.

156
00:03:30,119 --> 00:03:31,559
So I sent one

157
00:03:31,559 --> 00:03:32,440
and told him I was eating.

158
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:33,720
Then you popped up out of nowhere

159
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,440
