162
00:03:38,839 --> 00:03:39,679
I said,

163
00:03:39,679 --> 00:03:40,600
"Excuse me, what would you like to eat?"

164
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,199
"I can help you order."

165
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,880
It took him a second
to realize who I was.

166
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,520
Her voice is easy to tell apart.

167
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,360
Her voice

168
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,759
