184
00:04:13,279 --> 00:04:15,119
After leaving the house,

185
00:04:15,119 --> 00:04:16,519
Ruita and I

186
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,279
encountered

187
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,679
many real-life troubles,
whether long-distance separation

188
00:04:18,679 --> 00:04:20,600
or work issues.

189
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,239
But I think

190
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,880
that

191
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:25,600
we both took a positive attitude

192
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,000
