208
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:55,440
Let me ask these couples.

209
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,559
During this time,

210
00:04:56,559 --> 00:04:58,359
have you had

211
00:04:58,359 --> 00:04:59,480
