216
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,679
Yeah.

217
00:05:08,679 --> 00:05:11,200
The first time we met was in Shanghai,
right after filming wrapped.

218
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:13,160
Then the second time
was when she went to Beijing.

219
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,200
The third time I came to Shanghai again,

220
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,399
