222
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,320
What fun things happened?

223
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:21,920
The Beijing trip

224
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,519
was great fun.

225
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:24,279
Lots of fun things happened in Beijing.

226
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,799
And we always

227
00:05:26,799 --> 00:05:28,440
find fun things to do together.

228
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,640
For example,
we both love playing ball games.

229
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,200
So we often play ball games together.

230
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,359
Try some delicious food.

231
00:05:32,359 --> 00:05:33,600
We share similar tastes

232
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,440
