235
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:39,000
In terms of hobbies and interests,

236
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,200
we are quite similar.

237
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,519
So,

238
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,880
almost everything

239
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,640
