240
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:47,359
I just thought of a funny story

241
00:05:47,359 --> 00:05:49,040
about preparing his birthday gift.

242
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,920
That day, we were shopping in Beijing

243
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,399
and passed a store.

244
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:55,079
He once sent me a photo of a ring before

245
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:56,640
and texted to ask me if it looked good.

246
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,279
I replied that it looked nice.

247
00:05:58,320 --> 00:05:59,799
That day, in Beijing,

248
00:05:59,799 --> 00:06:00,959
