249
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:02,119
and he tried on that ring

250
00:06:02,119 --> 00:06:03,880
but left without buying it.

251
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:04,600
On my last day

252
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,040
